<title>USA: Horizon Group names Wassel CEO.</title>
<headline>Horizon Group names Wassel CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTON SHORES, Mich. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon Group Inc said Friday that it has named president and chief operating officer James Wassell as chief executive and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Wassell, 46, succeeds CEO Ron Piasecki, who continues as vice chairman of the board of directors and who will serve as chairman of the board's executive committee.</p>
<p>The company, which owns, operates and develops outlet centers, also said it declared an unchanged quarterly dividend of $0.35 a share for the second quarter, payable July 10, record June 30.</p>
</text>
